        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Kandih ram khou kaguang phei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih ram khou kaguang phei banni,",
            "Kandih munpuang guaini tuai puni;",
            "Aniu pantini suai mak na kei puni e,",
            "Kum sini akhang Jisu nai e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Lili puang lui kaguang Jisu 7#@,",
            "Puang the akhang 7#@ rui tingkau thang,",
            "Rianramei kan khou ni kamei rui duanglou,",
            "Tuai mak pui lili munpuang dai e.",
            "",
            "2. Kamei rui njianmei kandih khou,",
            "Kamei thu tingsang ganphiu dai e;",
            "Hei kandih khou rianra rianriu bam pusini,",
            "Tingkau thu phung kulou puni e.",
            "",
            "3. Ntau kapma bam pu sini na,",
            "Thie lana amik tangui pukhou;",
            "Ai ping lakkhe tarou khou rui thao pusini,",
            "Amik dui thut phui lou puni e.",
            "",
            "4. Kandih ram hei khou hei njianmei,",
            "Champan nun rui pat lou pusini;",
            "Alung khou hei njianmei ni pat puni e,",
            "Arana bam pui ding khou 7#@ni.",
            "",
            "5. Hei kum pusini ai ping lakkhe,",
            "Alung bumang rianra pusini;",
            "Lunggei kadanna arana bam pusini,",
            "Lili puang Jisu rui duang lou ni."
          ]
        }
      },
